Z||000001||Oreif||10-22-2001||09:08 AM||||What kind of information are you looking for? <P>I wrote an article for our club newsletter on installing stereo's in a Fiero. It is basically what you can install in a Fiero from a basic system to a full custom system. I've been installing Stereo's for over 16 years now.<P>------------------<BR>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">          <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><B><I>Happiness isn't around the corner...<BR>Happiness IS the corner.</I></B></FONT>||||reg||1
