Z||000011||Inspinout||10-26-2001||12:14 AM||||ooh audio my favorite..sounddomain is a great site for looking at other installs and contacting other owners..heres some other sites that may prove useful:<P>1)www.caraudioforum.com ..my home forum..lots of great people<BR>2)www.the12volt.com  ..covers the bases<BR>3)http://www.linearteam.org/winisd.html --WinISD is a great free modeling tool<BR>4)some cheap audio sites..that I have used: <A HREF="http://www.woofersetc.com" TARGET=_blank>www.woofersetc.com</A>  <A HREF="http://www.thezeb.com" TARGET=_blank>www.thezeb.com</A>  <A HREF="http://www.tmselectronics.com" TARGET=_blank>www.tmselectronics.com</A> <P><BR>hope that helps,<BR>Inspin||||reg||1
